    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just arrived at a place designated on your GPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A house in the middle of the forest. Great!&quot; - you say to yourself - &quot;What could go wrong?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a special operations team and &quot;there's nothing to be scared of&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason why you're here is to get prepared for incoming missions in Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There's a lot to learn and more to come&quot; - he says - &quot;And I cannot risk sending you to a mission inexperienced&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Personally, I prefer quick and condensed exercises for basics. Fret not though! Most of the tests, that are prepared, have different levels of difficulty and pace!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game focuses mainly on:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning the alphabet </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vocabulary </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game contains:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>regarding Greek alphabet</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different types of tests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 1000 variations of those tests in total</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>regarding vocabulary</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 10 subjects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 250 words to learn </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >help that tracks your progress </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features support working with Roman alphabet to Greek alphabet and vice versa. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aspects that are not available or appear only as mentions:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accents, speaking, pronunciation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >writing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grammar</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just arrived at a place designated on your GPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A house in the middle of the forest. Great!&quot; - you say to yourself - &quot;What could go wrong?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of a special operations team and &quot;there's nothing to be scared of&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason why you're here is to get prepared for incoming missions in Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There's a lot to learn and more to come&quot; - he says - &quot;And I cannot risk sending you to a mission inexperienced&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Personally, I prefer quick and condensed exercises for basics. Fret not though! Most of the tests, that are prepared, have different levels of difficulty and pace!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game focuses mainly on:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learning the alphabet </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vocabulary </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game contains:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>regarding Greek alphabet</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different types of tests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 1000 variations of those tests in total</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>regarding vocabulary</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than 10 subjects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 250 words to learn </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >help that tracks your progress </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features support working with Roman alphabet to Greek alphabet and vice versa. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aspects that are not available or appear only as mentions:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accents, speaking, pronunciation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >writing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grammar</p></li></ul>",
